<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13698" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποσκευάξω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pull off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν ὀροφήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lycurg.
					128
				</span></i>
			; <i>clear away</i> tables, <i><span class="en">
				Suid.
			</span></i>; <i>strip of furniture,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκίαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>Le.</u>
					14.36
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξημιόω</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> mostly in 
				Med.
			, <i>pack up and carry off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι τῶν ἰδίων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					633.68
				</span></i>
			 (Milet., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>), cf.<i><span class="en">
				588.50
			</span></i> (ib., <span class="entity">ii B.C.</span>, 
				Pass.
			), <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				2.26.6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				9.23
			</span></i>: abs., <i>pack up and depart,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Act.Ap.
				21.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>get rid of,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἐνοχλοῦντα </span>( 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποπατέω</span>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				5.91
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				4.13.4
			</span></i>; <i>remove,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φιλίας τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Cal.</u>
					12
				</span></i>
			; <i>make away with, kill,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Tyr.</u>
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
				2.5.1
			</span></i>; <i>get rid of, confute,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὺς σοφιστάς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					8.19
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be expelled,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σωμάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dsc.
					<u>Ther.Praef.</u>
				</span></i>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>repel,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἰτίαν, διαβολάς,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>BJ</u>
				2.16.5
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.24.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>reject,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Ph.</u>
				888.15
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>5.</b>
			<i>defer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διήγησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hld.
					5.1
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>6.</b>
			<i>transfer,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔς τινας τὰς αἰτίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					2.66d
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
